|lead='''Han’s Heavy Blaster Pistol (V)''' is the [[Light]] [[Weapon]] printing on the [[Virtual Set 1: Legacy (Premium Edition)|Virtual Set #1 Premium Edition]] sheet.<ref name="premium-source">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/legacyblocks/VirtualCards1Premium.pdf Virtual Set #1 Premium Edition], [[Players Committee]], p. 1. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261008193754/https://res.starwarsccg.org/legacyblocks/VirtualCards1Premium.pdf Internet Archive]. Wiki copy: [[Media:VirtualCards1Premium.pdf|Premium Edition source sheet]].</ref>
|lore=BlasTech DL-44 heavy blaster pistol. Short range, but relatively powerful. Carries energy for 25 shots. Illegal or restricted in most systems.
|game_text=Deploy on Han (except TK-422), even as a ‘react’. May target a character for free. Draw destiny. Target hit (opponent loses 1 Force) and its forfeit = 0, if destiny +1 > defense value. May fire once during your control phase for 1 Force.
|sources=* [[Media:VirtualCards1Premium.pdf|Virtual Set #1 Premium Edition]], p. 1, collector 1•4.<ref name="premium-source" />
